window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Killian</b></p> <p>My best friend's little sister. Entirely off-limits. A craving I cannot resist.</p> <p>Savannah Levine is the one woman I cannot have and the only one I want. I keep her at arm's length, but there's no denying that she is an addiction I'm too weak to ignore.</p> <p>One taste. One touch. I should have known it would never be enough.</p> <p>Selfishly, I steal touches and kisses in the dark, keeping us a secret from those closest to us. But in a circle like mine, lies tend to catch up on you, and justice is served in the most tragic of ways.</p> <p>There's no way a man like me gets to keep the girl.</p> <p><b>Savannah</b></p> <p>My brother's best friend. A man I have no right wanting. A broken heart waiting to happen.</p> <p>Killian Archer has owned my heart from the moment I met him. I thought it would ease with time, that this feeling would end, but it only grew. I assumed it was unrequited until one night, one date gone wrong, and a kiss to seal our fates, catapulted us straight into the danger zone.</p> <p>We are fire. Burning into embers. And the more we sneak around, the more I fall.</p> <p>Until it's all ripped away and I'm left scrambling to find all the missing pieces. The thing about a love like ours is that it was never built to last. You can hope, and you can pray, but when you're built on a foundation of secrets and lies, cracks begin to show.</p> <p>And when the walls finally fall, I won't even have the memories to remind me that it was real.</p> <p>Embers of Us <i>is a full-length brother's best friend romance following Killian and Savannah. Contains mature content. A complete list of content warnings can be found on the author's website.</i></p>"; 
